@page: index
@title: Vision Properties · Real estate marketing & investment consulting, Karachi
@desc: Vision Properties markets apartments, plots and commercial projects across Karachi, from the DHA Phase VIII seafront to Jinnah Avenue and the M-9. Honest guidance from blueprint to keys.
